# Design systems

Rinse has **two visual lanes**. Do not mix tokens across them.

## Operator light (default app)

**Routes:** `/`, `/jobs`, `/clients`, `/settings`, `/invoices`, sheets, FAB  
**Tokens:** `rinse-api/src/app/tokens.css` → `--bg-*`, `--green`, `--text-*`  
**CSS:** `globals.css`, `app-ui.css`, `light-sheet.css`  
**Accent:** `#22c55e` via `--green` / `--green-text`

## Client light (customer-facing)

**Routes:** `/book/*`, `/portal/*`, auth (`auth-flow.css`)  
**Wrapper:** `.client-light-root`  
**Tokens:** `client-light.css` → `--cl-bg`, `--cl-surface`, `--cl-accent`, etc.  
**CSS:** `book.css`, `portal.css`, `forms/light-form.css`

Portal may toggle dark via `usePortalTheme` — scoped to `.portal-root`, not operator shell.

## Sheets

- **Operator forms:** `BottomSheet` with `variant="light"` (default)
- **Pickers:** `VaulSheet` for lightweight pickers only
- Do not port operator inv-sheet chrome into portal/book without scoping under client-light

## Typography

- Display: Syne (`--font-display`)
- Body/UI: DM Sans (`--font-body`, `--font-ui`)

